  "description": "Drag & drop files into WindowSill for instant processing — single files or entire batches.\n\n      • Convert documents, spreadsheets and presentations to supported formats\n      • Merge, split, extract and compress PDFs, save pages as images, and add or remove passwords\n      • Inspect ZIP archives without extracting them\n      • Re-encode text files and switch between Windows and Unix line endings\n\n      All the essential file tools you need, right in your digital window sill.",
